{
  "title": "Kissed Fluffy Portuguese Cannellini Bean Stew",
  "description": "A fresh and fluffy Portuguese dish featuring cannellini beans, this stew is a nostalgic and diabetic-friendly option for a weeknight dinner. It incorporates a shio-koji cure for added depth of flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
  "diet": [
